                                                "sense_id": "e7b169b9-b2a8-3bad-bd93-9022a9a22ec1",
                                                "text": "like blue bottle flees in a blink of sunshine, […]A bonny bike there’s o’ them!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "205359e1-1a2b-4426-bbed-c771dcc6a69b",
                                                "sense_id": "e7b169b9-b2a8-3bad-bd93-9022a9a22ec1",
                                                "text": "he stood for a minute talking to them about their job of gathering cones, and telling them a story about a tree he’d once climbed which had a wasp’s byke in it unbeknown to him."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
